  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Judicial Education Partnership - Centre for European Development and Integration (CEDI)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project directly addresses the skill and capacity gaps in Albania&#x2019;s judiciary by strengthening the professional skills and ethical standards of magistrates to improve courtroom management, judgement writing, and judicial ethics. Through strategic cooperation with the UK Judicial Office, the project will introduce efficient models and practices from the UK to help Albania align with European standards of justice quality and efficiency.</narrative>
  </description>
